    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|001",
      "full_original_stem": "在進行光的行進路線實驗時，讓盒子充滿煙，是為了清楚地看到光的路線。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.64,
        217.72,
        93.83,
        236.63
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|002",
      "full_original_stem": "一氧化碳偵測警報器是一種具有警示功能的物品。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.64,
        257.68,
        93.83,
        276.59
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|003",
      "full_original_stem": "上學時，安可看到影子出現在他的右手邊，此時太陽光是從她的右邊照射過來。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.63,
        297.63,
        93.82,
        316.55
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|004",
      "full_original_stem": "當物體的振動停止時，我們還是可以聽見物體持續發出聲音。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.64,
        337.71,
        93.85,
        356.63
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|005",
      "full_original_stem": "洗完澡，為了節省時間，溼溼的手可以直接拿吹風機的插頭插入插座吹乾頭髮。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.64,
        377.67,
        93.83,
        396.58
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|006",
      "full_original_stem": "電器不使用時，電池也可以繼續裝在裡面沒有關係。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.63,
        417.63,
        93.82,
        436.54
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|007",
      "full_original_stem": "耳朵貼在門板上無法聽到門外的聲音。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.6,
        457.7,
        93.79,
        476.61
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|008",
      "full_original_stem": "延長線可以同時連接很多個電器。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.58,
        477.62,
        93.78,
        496.53
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|009",
      "full_original_stem": "教室的電燈是使用燈泡串聯的方式連接。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.57,
        497.66,
        93.76,
        516.57
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|010",
      "full_original_stem": "電線外層是塑膠，我們不會觸電是因為塑膠是電的不良導體。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.57,
        517.69,
        93.78,
        536.6
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|011",
      "full_original_stem": "單車加裝反光板可以增加騎乘的安全。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.57,
        557.65,
        93.76,
        576.56
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|012",
      "full_original_stem": "廢電池裡的化學物質具有毒性，會危害環境，所以必須放入電池回收桶裡回收。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.54,
        577.69,
        93.75,
        596.6
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|013",
      "full_original_stem": "為避免觸電，我們會用塑膠材質來製作電器開關的外殼。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.54,
        617.64,
        93.73,
        636.55
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "SCI_G04_S1_114_FINAL_007|S01|TF|014",
      "full_original_stem": "地震時，手機會用警報聲來提醒民眾注意，這是利用聲音來警示危險。",
      "answer_marker_pdf_bbox_pts_top_left": [
        56.53,
        657.6,
